JRawr Legacy Oracle Snapshot
Copyright 2026 Adriano Botti and the JRawr contributors.

This repository is a development-only snapshot of the WotLK 3.3.5a Rawr reference
implementation used to generate and verify JRawr's C# oracle. It is not part of a
JRawr runtime release.

