WotLK fork and local integration
--------------------------------
This snapshot is based on the RAWR_WotLK_3.3.5a fork maintained by Magmonix
(https://github.com/Magmonix/RAWR_WotLK_3.3.5a), commit
4f2bdc09e68a24b0efefab8830861ef6b44f8992. The local WotLK Classic integration,
Wine/Mono fixes and rebuilt Rawr.Base.dll are commit
46f190bee32964cc8df5fe853d95b8a343f5aa23 by Adriano Botti.

